/span> <span begin="02:58.324" end="02:59.571">with</span> <span begin="02:59.571" end="03:00.194">me</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">快回来吧</span></p><p begin="03:03.855" end="03:11.214" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L28"><span begin="03:03.855" end="03:04.738">And</span> <span begin="03:04.738" end="03:05.032">I</span> <span begin="03:05.032" end="03:07.093">watched</span> <span begin="03:07.093" end="03:07.976">the</span> <span begin="03:07.976" end="03:08.565">wa</span><span begin="03:08.565" end="03:09.448">ter</span> <span begin="03:09.448" end="03:10.037">un</span><span begin="03:10.037" end="03:11.214">fold</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我亲眼所见这展开的水域</span></p><p begin="03:11.214" end="03:17.383" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L29"><span begin="03:11.214" end="03:11.954">It's</span> <span begin="03:11.954" end="03:12.201">a</span> <span begin="03:12.201" end="03:12.941">fee</span><span begin="03:12.941" end="03:13.928">ling</span> <span begin="03:13.928" end="03:14.175">I</span> <span begin="03:14.175" end="03:15.162">want</span> <span begin="03:15.162" end="03:15.902">you</span> <span begin="03:15.902" end="03:16.396">to</span> <span begin="03:16.396" end="03:17.383">know</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">这是一种 我迫切想与你感同的身受</span></p><p begin="03:18.711" end="03:26.015" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L30"><span begin="03:18.711" end="03:19.587">And</span> <span begin="03:19.587" end="03:19.880">I</span> <span begin="03:19.880" end="03:21.925">watched</span> <span begin="03:21.925" end="03:22.801">the</span> <span begin="03:22.801" end="03:23.386">wa</span><span begin="03:23.386" end="03:24.262">ter</span> <span begin="03:24.262" end="03:24.846">un</span><span begin="03:24.846" end="03:26.015">fold</span><span ttm:role="x-translation" xml:lang="zh-CN">我亲眼所见这展开的水域</span></p><p begin="03:26.015" end="03:32.955" ttm:agent="v1" itunes:key="L31"><span begin="03:26.015" end="03:26.920">It's</span> <span begin="03:26